                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to Chargé
                    Coolidge.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1905-02-27"><hi rendition="#italic">February 27,
                        1905</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Your 1792 received. Counter-draft project submitted acceptable to this
                    government.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Adee.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
